{"id":"83345981d6558f8e","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-adequacy-conditions.md","title":"基础语言的材料充分性","display":"df-adequacy-conditions — 基础语言的材料充分性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-adequacy-conditions","aliases":["91-df-adequacy-conditions","91-df-tarski-adequacy"],"display":"df-adequacy-conditions — 基础语言的材料充分性","depends_on":["[[91-df-T-schema]]","[[91-df-truth-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-adequacy-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-adequacy-conditions</span><span>91-df-tarski-adequacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adequacy-conditions — 基础语言的材料充分性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" href=\"?note=ba367ff1b4bb3da3\" title=\"91-df-T-schema\">91-df-T-schema</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"024b320d234d188f\" href=\"?note=024b320d234d188f\" title=\"91-df-truth-theory\">91-df-truth-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-adequacy-conditions-—-基础语言的材料充分性-$\\mathrm{Adeq}$\">df-adequacy-conditions — 基础语言的材料充分性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Adeq}\">\\(\\mathrm{Adeq}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_T\">\\(\\mathcal T_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (基础理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (基础语言及其真理扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\">\\(T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\\)</span> (真理谓词符号)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adeq}(\\mathcal T_T,S,\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\nS\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land \\mathcal T_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adeq}(\\mathcal T_T,S,\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\nS\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land \\mathcal T_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Tarski 式材料充分性的理论版本：扩张基础理论，并逐个证明指定\n对象语言的 T-双条件。它没有把保守性、语法一致性、语义声性或\n“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 在基础语言中不可定义”并入定义。</p>\n<p>这些性质逻辑上彼此独立：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TB、UTB 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span> 对 PA 材料充分且算术保守；</li>\n<li>标准 KF 也能在基础算术句上恢复相应双条件，但并不对 PA 保守；</li>\n<li>将实例域改成全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 句子，会在经典自指环境中受到\n说谎者反例，而不再是这里定义的材料充分性。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相对一致性必须写成明确的元理论或形式化蕴涵，并由模型/解释证明。\n不能仅凭材料充分性表格给一个理论无条件打上“一致”标记。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-adequacy-conditions-—-基础语言的材料充分性-$\\mathrm{Adeq}$","text":"df-adequacy-conditions — 基础语言的材料充分性 $\\mathrm{Adeq}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-T-schema","status":"resolved","id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-T-schema]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-theory","status":"resolved","id":"024b320d234d188f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-theory]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Adeq}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_T","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0\\subseteq\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adequacy\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Adeq}(\\mathcal T_T,S,\\mathcal L_0)\n\\coloneqq\nS\\subseteq\\mathcal T_T\n\\land \\mathcal T_T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\land T\\in\\mathrm{Pred}_{\\mathcal L_T}^{1}\n\\land\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal T_T\\vdash\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false}],"bytes":1790,"backlinks":[{"id":"58c35051f3ea09e6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"967c10482b90bea3","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-adequacy-conditions]]"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-89","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-adequacy-conditions]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-KF.md]]\n[[91-df-T-closure.md]]\n[[91-df-T-schema.md]]\n[[91-df-TB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-TB.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB-plus.md]]\n[[91-df-UTB.md]]\n[[91-df-VF.md]]\n[[